"Os corsários levaram o azeite das aldeias. Descubram o que querem e recuperem-no com trocas."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The olive trees of the Adriatic grow very old: near Bar in Montenegro stands an olive tree which "
"is said to be more than two thousand years old."
msgstr ""
"As oliveiras do Adriático vivem muito tempo: perto de Bar, no Montenegro, há uma oliveira que "
"dizem ter mais de dois mil anos."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The oil is home!"
msgstr "O azeite está em casa!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not a single shot was fired: a sail, a jar of honey and a sack of salt did it."
msgstr "Não houve um único tiro: uma vela, um frasco de mel e um saco de sal resolveram tudo."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Even the corsair captain is your friend now."
msgstr "Até o capitão dos corsários é agora vosso amigo."

